description.desc:
Press <IconMap:Icon_Normal> to activate:
Launches up to 4 consecutive attacks forward, dealing <color=#A6C5FD>Wind DMG</color>;
After the 4th attack hits an enemy, accumulates 20 <Term:1000041></Term>;
The moment the 4th attack is launched, it has a dodge window. If an enemy attack is successfully dodged, the DMG Multiplier and Daze Multiplier of this Basic Attack become equal to those of <color=#FFFFFF>[Basic Attack: Fierce Spin]</color>, and additionally accumulates 15 <color=#FFFFFF>[Flux]</color>;
Character is invulnerable during the 4th attack;
When Severian uses <color=#FFFFFF>[Dodge]</color>, <color=#FFFFFF>[Dash Attack]</color>, <color=#FFFFFF>[Dodge Counter]</color>, or <color=#FFFFFF>[Dodge: Freeform]</color> during a <color=#FFFFFF>[Basic Attack]</color>, the <color=#FFFFFF>[Basic Attack]</color> combo count will not be interrupted.

Automatically activates when hit by an enemy attack at the instant of launching the first three Basic Attacks, or when hit by a non-Control Skill enemy attack while the <color=#FFFFFF>[Flickering Shadow]</color> effect is active and the character does not have an invulnerable effect:
Dashes forward, dealing massive <color=#A6C5FD>Wind DMG</color> to enemies in front;
Upon activating this skill, accumulates 15 <Term:1000041></Term>. Hitting an enemy additionally accumulates 20 <color=#FFFFFF>[Flowing Breath]</color>;
Upon activating this skill, hold <IconMap:Icon_Normal> to Quick Launch <color=#FFFFFF>[Basic Attack: Galewind Shadow Hunt]</color>;
Character is invulnerable while using this skill.

When <Term:1000041></Term> is sufficient, consume 100 points of <color=#FFFFFF>[Flowing Breath]</color> and hold <IconMap:Icon_Normal> to activate:
First, dodge backward to gather momentum, then continuously dash across the battlefield unleashing relentless Slashes, dealing massive <color=#A6C5FD>Wind DMG</color> to enemies in front;
During the backward dodge, dodge detection is active. Successfully dodging an enemy attack triggers <color=#FFFFFF>[Vital View]</color> and accumulates 15 points of <color=#FFFFFF>[Flowing Breath]</color>;
Character is invulnerable while using this skill.

Press <IconMap:Icon_Evade> to activate:
A quick dash dodge;
Triggering <color=#FFFFFF>[Perfect Dodge]</color> via <color=#FFFFFF>[Dodge: Drift]</color> accumulates 15 <Term:1000041></Term>. This effect can trigger once every 0.5 sec;
Character is invulnerable while using this skill.

When <color=#FFFFFF>[Perfect Dodge]</color> is triggered via <color=#FFFFFF>[Dodge: Drift]</color>, Press <IconMap:Icon_Normal> to activate:
Launches a rapid slash forward, dealing <color=#A6C5FD>Wind DMG</color>;
If the character switches off-field at the moment <color=#FFFFFF>[Perfect Dodge]</color> is triggered via <color=#FFFFFF>[Dodge: Drift]</color>, this skill will be activated automatically;
Character is invulnerable while using this skill.

After a Backstep, hold <IconMap:Icon_Evade> to activate:
Provoke the enemy;
If hit during this skill, consume <color=#FFFFFF>[Flash Shadow]</color> to trigger <color=#FFFFFF>[Basic Attack: Blazing Spin]</color>. The triggered <color=#FFFFFF>[Basic Attack: Blazing Spin]</color> is guaranteed to CRIT, and CRIT DMG is increased by 10%.

With enough Energy, press <IconMap:Icon_SpecialReady> to activate:
Unleash a combo of Slash, claw, and cannon strikes, dealing massive <color=#A6C5FD>Wind DMG</color> to enemies and gaining 1 stack of <Term:1000042></Term>;
Hold <IconMap:Icon_SpecialReady> to continuously consume Energy before the cannon strike, launching wind blades that deal <color=#A6C5FD>Wind DMG</color> to enemies;
When Energy Cost reaches max, gain an additional stack of <color=#FFFFFF>[Shimmer]</color>;
Character is invulnerable while using this skill.

When Decibel Rating is at <color=#FFFFFF>Maximum</color>, press <IconMap:Icon_UltimateReady> to activate:
Unleashes multiple rapid Slashes in succession, dealing massive <color=#A6C5FD>Wind DMG</color>;
After using this skill, accumulates 100 points of <Term:1000041></Term>;
Character is invulnerable while using this skill.

When Severian has the <Term:1000043> effect and is in-combat, press <IconMap:Icon_Switch> to switch from off field to on field:
Launches a powerful Slash at enemies ahead, dealing <color=#A6C5FD>Wind DMG</color>;
Upon activating this skill, it counts as a <color=#FFFFFF>[Quick Assist]</color>;
Character is invulnerable while using this skill.

